WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:11.110
Ɗigo uku. Kafin safiya, gaskiya za ta
bayyana.

2
00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:16.930
Mama ce da kanta ta dafa miki! Miyar
barkono ta musamman!

3
00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:24.250
Tun yaushe Mama ke dafa min abinci?

4
00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:29.130
Sha, 'yata. Yana da kyau ga ciki.

5
00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:32.450
To maza.

6
00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:39.500
Jira… mene ne wannan?

7
00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:45.510
Yesu!

8
00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:47.450
Mama, me kika saka a cikin miyar nan?!

9
00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:55.510
Shafewa ce! Shafewa! Shafewa tana ɗan
ɗaci!

10
00:00:57.670 --> 00:01:00.300
Ehn ehn! Matsala ta sauka!

11
00:01:01.970 --> 00:01:03.240
Ya Allah!

12
00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:09.820
Ada… ban ji daɗin wannan ba ko kaɗan.

13
00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:11.700
Nuna min.

14
00:01:16.940 --> 00:01:19.550
Mama, ke fara. Ke kika dafa.

15
00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:27.700
A ranar na gane cewa… miyar ba ni kaɗai
aka yi wa ba.
